","room","is","too","small."]},{"id":"en-a2-07-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Too small ma’nosi?","answers":["smaller than needed"],"explanation":"Too kerakdan ortiq darajani bildiradi.","hint":"a careful driver → drives carefully; too small / big enough","options":["smaller than needed","a good small size","large enough"]},{"id":"en-a2-07-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["We have enough space."],"explanation":"Sifat ot yoki to be dan keyin: a careful driver, the room is quiet. Ravish harakatni tasvirlaydi: drives carefully. Ko‘p ravishlar -ly oladi, ammo good → well, fast → fast istisno. She speaks well — yaxshi gapiradi. Too + sifat kerakdan ortiqlik; sifat + enough yetarlilik: too small, big enough. Enough + ot: enough space.","hint":"a careful driver → drives carefully; too small / big enough","tokens":["We","have","enough","space."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-a2-07","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-a2-07","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-grammar","name":"British Council — Grammar","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"grammar","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/grammar","t