les / few apples; a little time / little time","options":["some time","many separate times","no time at all"]}],[{"id":"en-a2-08-exit-b0","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["There are few buses today."],"explanation":"A few ko‘plik sanaladigan ot bilan oz bo‘lsa ham bor degani. Few juda kam, ko‘pincha yetarli emas ma’nosini beradi. A little sanalmaydigan ot bilan ozgina bor; little juda kamligini ko‘rsatadi. A little water va little water bir xil ohang emas. Miqdor aniq raqam bo‘lmasligi mumkin. Matndagi vazifa va so‘zlovchining bahosiga qarab yetarlilikni tushuning.","hint":"a few apples / few apples; a little time / little time","tokens":["There","are","few","buses","today."]},{"id":"en-a2-08-exit-b1","type":"grammarFill","skill":"grammar","prompt":"a ___ milk","answers":["little"],"explanation":"A few ko‘plik sanaladigan ot bilan oz bo‘lsa ham bor degani. Few juda kam, ko‘pincha yetarli emas ma’nosini beradi. A little sanalmaydigan ot bilan ozgina bor; little juda kamligini ko‘rsatadi. A little water va little water bir xil ohang emas. Miqdor aniq raqam bo‘lmasligi mumkin. Matndagi vazifa va so‘zlovchining bahosiga qarab yetarlilikni tushuning.","hint":"a few apples / few apples; a little time / little time"},{"id":"en-a2-08-exit-b2","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["We have little water left."],"explanation":"A few ko‘plik sanaladigan ot bilan oz bo‘lsa ham bor degani. Few juda kam, ko‘pincha yetarli emas ma’nosini beradi. A little sanalmaydigan ot bilan ozgina bor; little juda kamligini ko‘rsatadi. A little water va little water bir xil ohang emas. Miqdor aniq raqam bo‘lmasligi mumkin. Matndagi vazifa va so‘zlovchining bahosiga qarab yetarlilikni tushuning.","hint":"a few apples / few apples; a little time / little time","tokens":["We","have","little","water","left."]},{"id":"en-a2-08-exit-b3","type":"choice","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Few va a few bir xil ohangmi?","answers":["No"],"explanation":"Few ko‘proq kamlik muammosini ta’kidlaydi.","hint":"a few apples / few apples; a little time / little time","options":["No","Yes","Always"]},{"id":"en-a2-08-exit-b4","type":"order","skill":"grammar","prompt":"Gapni tartiblang.","answers":["She adds a little milk."],"explanation":"A few ko‘plik sanaladigan ot bilan oz bo‘lsa ham bor degani. Few juda kam, ko‘pincha yetarli emas ma’nosini beradi. A little sanalmaydigan ot bilan ozgina bor; little juda kamligini ko‘rsatadi. A little water va little water bir xil ohang emas. Miqdor aniq raqam bo‘lmasligi mumkin. Matndagi vazifa va so‘zlovchining bahosiga qarab yetarlilikni tushuning.","hint":"a few apples / few apples; a little time / little time","tokens":["She","adds","a","little","milk."]}]],"sources":[{"id":"cefr","name":"Council of Europe — CEFR daraja tavsiflari","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"framework","url":"https://www.coe.int/en/web/common-european-framework-reference-languages/level-descriptions","task":"Dars maqsadini qila olaman tavsifi bilan solishtiring. PRE — kursning tayyorlov bosqichi.","lesson":"en-a2-08","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"pronunciation","name":"Cambridge Dictionary — Pronunciation","levels":["PRE","A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"pronunciation","url":"https://dictionary.cambridge.org/pronunciation/","task":"Darsdan ikki so‘z tanlang, UK/US talaffuzini eshiting va urg‘uni qayd eting.","lesson":"en-a2-08","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida bajariladi; himoyalangan matn yoki audio ko‘chirilmagan."},{"id":"bc-grammar","name":"British Council — Grammar","levels":["A1","A2","B1","B2","C1"],"skill":"grammar","url":"https://learnenglish.britishcouncil.org/free-resources/grammar","task":"Darajangizdagi dars mavzusini toping va bitta o‘xshash misol yozing.","lesson":"en-a2-08","verified":"2026-10-05","mode":"link","rights":"Manba saytida b